cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
title: "OpenRouter and OpenCode Usage History (wss-openrouter)"
abstract: >-
  Weekly point-in-time captures of OpenRouter's task mix, session economics,
  benchmarks, model catalogue and provider directory, plus OpenCode's usage
  telemetry: model and lab shares, session cost, cache ratio, retention and
  geography. Captured because the publishers do not archive the windows these
  endpoints expose.
authors:
  - name: "neldivad"
    website: "https://github.com/neldivad"
  - name: "q3dresearch"
    website: "https://github.com/q3dresearch"
# No `license:` field: CC BY 4.0 covers 5 of 8 sources; openrouter.models.catalog,
# openrouter.providers.directory and opencode.data.usage state no licence grant, so no
# blanket claim is made. See LICENSE-DATA for the per-source table
# The CODE is MIT (see LICENSE); this file cites the DATASET.
keywords:
  - git-scraping
  - open-data
  - point-in-time-data
  - dataset
